<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine posts $368.9 mln trade deficit in January.</title>
<headline>Ukraine posts $368.9 mln trade deficit in January.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine posted a trade deficit of $368.9 million in January 1997, the Statistics Ministry said on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
<p> UKRAINE MERCHANDISE TRADE   Jan '97    Jan-Dec '96 Jan '96</p>
<p> Exports ($bln)		 0.960	 14.061	0.782</p>
<p> Imports ($bln)		 1.329	 18.203	0.976</p>
<p> Balance ($million)		 -368.9	-4,141.7    -193.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are for trade with all countries. Trade with former Soviet republics resulted in a deficit of $547.8 million in January.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
